config BR2_PACKAGE_VL53L1X
	bool "vl53l1x"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  Out-of-tree character device driver for the ST VL53L1X
	  time-of-flight ranging sensor, plus the device tree overlay
	  that binds it to I2C1 and GPIO17 on a Raspberry Pi 4.

	  Exposes one measurement per open() through /dev/vl53l1x0,
	  driven by the sensor's data-ready interrupt.

comment "vl53l1x needs a Linux kernel to be built"
	depends on !BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
